						<p class="Texttable" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;">You should carefully read the &#8220;<span class="Italic" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">Risk Factors</span>&#8221; beginning on page&#160;6 and the other information included in this prospectus for a discussion of factors you should consider carefully before deciding to invest in our Class&#160;A Common Stock.</p>
